<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">迷人姑娘 你是我重整心绪的动力</text><text for="L2">教我谨言慎行 改尽往日脾性</text><text for="L3">心仪的伊人 你掌控着我的心跳</text><text for="L4">让我忍不住拨通号码 只为听一听你的声音</text><text for="L5">告诉我你期许的一切</text><text for="L6">我定当倾尽所有悉数奉上</text><text for="L7">睁开双眸 你便会明了</text><text for="L8">这世界唯有你我相依</text><text for="L9">唯有彼此</text><text for="L10">连门钥匙也抛开</text><text for="L11">沉醉在专属的幻梦里</text><text for="L12">这世界唯有你我相依</text><text for="L13">再无旁人</text><text for="L14">静静聆听你的每一次吐息</text><text for="L15">流连在不愿醒来的梦境</text><text for="L16">这世界唯有你我相依</text><text for="L17">你是诱人的劫难 亦是我唯一的归宿</text><text for="L18">你让我恍惚以为 自己也能主宰你</text><text for="L19">心爱的姑娘 你是我深陷其中的汹涌汪洋</text><text for="L20">将我彻底淹没 赐我你无尽的深情</text><text for="L21">告诉我你期许的一切 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(你的所求)</span></text><text for="L22">我愿倾尽一切悉数奉上 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我所拥有)</span></text><text for="L23">睁开双眸 你自会看清</text><text for="L24">这天地只剩你我相伴</text><text for="L25">唯有彼此</text><text for="L26">把钥匙丢掉 不再回头</text><text for="L27">长醉在这场幻梦之中</text><text for="L28">天地间只剩你我并肩</text><text for="L29">再无旁人</text><text for="L30">侧耳细听你的微弱呼吸</text><text for="L31">沉沦在这片迷离梦境</text><text for="L32">只余下你我相伴相守</text><text for="L33">将我吞没 彻底将我淹没</text><text for="L34">此刻就将我全身心占领</text><text for="L35">我绝不愿从这幻境中醒来</text><text for="L36">这世界唯有你我相依</text><text for="L37">将我吞没 彻底将我淹没</text><text for="L38">此刻就将我全盘接管</text><text for="L39">我甘愿沉沦永不醒转</text><text for="L40">这方天地唯留你我</text><text for="L41">如梦似幻的绮丽之境</text><text for="L42">如痴如醉的梦幻世界</text><text for="L43">将我淹没 彻底将我俘获</text><text for="L44">此刻就完全将我占据</text><text for="L45">我不想醒来 别让我醒来 不愿醒来 再也不愿醒来</text><text for="L46">静静聆听你的温柔呼吸</text><text for="L47">沉醉在这片不醒的幻梦中</text><text for="L48">这世界唯有你我相依</text><text for="L49">唯有彼此</text><text for="L50">索性将钥匙远远抛开</text><text for="L51">安歇在永恒的梦境里</text><text for="L52">这世界唯有你我相守</text><text for="L53">梦境缥缈的世外桃源</text><text for="L54">唯余你我二人相依</text><text for="L55">如梦如幻的天地</text><text for="L56">唯有彼此</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71816165"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Only"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437949212"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:10.245" end="2:56.595"><p begin="0:10.245" end="0:14.755" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.245" end="0:10.425">Oh,</span> <span begin="0:10.425" end="0:10.855">pret</span><span begin="0:10.855" end="0:10.975">ty</span> <span begin="0:10.975" end="0:11.655">ba</span><span begin="0:11.655" end="0:11.955">by,</span> <span begin="0:11.955" end="0:12.435">you're</span> <span begin="0:12.435" end="0:12.685">my</span> <span begin="0:12.685" end="0:13.105">mo</span><span begin="0:13.105" end="0:13.335">ti</span><span begin="0:13.335" end="0:13.945">va</span><span begin="0:13.945" end="0:14.755">tor</span></p><p begin="0:15.065" end="0:19.145" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.065" end="0:15.365">Got</span> <span begin="0:15.365" end="0:15.555">me</span> <span begin="0:15.555" end="0:15.995">chang</span><span begin="0:15.995" end="0:16.235">ing</span> <span begin="0:16.235" end="0:16.495">my</span> <span begin="0:16.495" end="0:17.205">words</span> <span begin="0:17.205" end="0:17.415">and</span> <span begin="0:17.415" end="0:17.665">my</span> <span begin="0:17.665" end="0:17.905">be</span><span begin="0:17.905" end="0:18.525">ha</span><span begin="0:18.525" end="0:19.145">vior</span></p><p begin="0:19.605" end="0:23.985" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.605" end="0:20.015">Pret</span><span begin="0:20.015" end="0:20.165">ty</span> <span begin="0:20.165" end="0:20.845">la</span><span begin="0:20.845" end="0:21.115">dy,</span> <span begin="0:21.115" end="0:21.595">you're</span> <span begin="0:21.595" end="0:21.965">my</span> <span begin="0:21.965" end="0:22.255">op</span><span begin="0:22.255" end="0:22.585">er</span><span begin="0:22.585" end="0:23.105">a</span><span begin="0:23.105" end="0:23.985">tor</span></p><p begin="0:24.215" end="0:28.145" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.215" end="0:24.515">Got</span> <span begin="0:24.515" end="0:24.755">me</span> <span begin="0:24.755" end="0:25.095">di</span><span begin="0:25.095" end="0:25.195">al</span><span begin="0:25.195" end="0:25.515">ling</span> <span begin="0:25.515" end="0:25.995">your</span> <span begin="0:25.995" end="0:26.265">num</span><span begin="0:26.265" end="0:26.455">ber</span> <span begin="0:26.455" end="0:26.825">just</span> <span begin="0:26.825" end="0:27.065">to</span> <span begin="0:27.065" end="0:27.585">hear</span> <span begin="0:27.585" end="0:28.145">ya</span></p><p begin="0:28.155" end="0:30.075" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.155" end="0:28.425">Tell</span> <span begin="0:28.425" end="0:28.575">me</span> <span begin="0:28.575" end="0:28.725">the</span> <span begin="0:28.725" end="0:29.015">things</span> <span begin="0:29.015" end="0:29.185">that</span> <span begin="0:29.185" end="0:29.405">you</span> <span begin="0:29.405" end="0:30.075">want</span></p><p begin="0:30.555" end="0:32.405" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.555" end="0:30.715">I</span> <span begin="0:30.715" end="0:30.925">give</span> <span begin="0:30.925" end="0:31.155">you</span> <span begin="0:31.155" end="0:31.325">all</span> <span begin="0:31.325" end="0:31.495">that</span> <span begin="0:31.495" end="0:31.705">I've</span> <span begin="0:31.705" end="0:32.405">got</span></p><p begin="0:32.765" end="0:35.695" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.765" end="0:32.985">O</span><span begin="0:32.985" end="0:33.195">pen</span> <span begin="0:33.195" end="0:33.445">your</span> <span begin="0:33.445" end="0:33.955">eyes,</span> <span begin="0:33.955" end="0:34.255">then</span> <span begin="0:34.255" end="0:34.545">you</span> <span begin="0:34.545" end="0:34.685">will</span> <span begin="0:34.685" end="0:35.695">see</span></p><p begin="0:35.695" end="0:37.235" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.695" end="0:35.905">It's</span> <span begin="0:35.905" end="0:36.255">just</span> <span begin="0:36.255" end="0:36.575">you</span> <span begin="0:36.575" end="0:36.695">and</span> <span begin="0:36.695" end="0:37.235">me</span></p><p begin="0:38.855" end="0:39.515" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.855" end="0:39.125">On</span><span begin="0:39.125" end="0:39.515">ly</span></p><p begin="0:40.795" end="0:42.475" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.795" end="0:41.155">Throw</span><span begin="0:41.155" end="0:41.405">ing</span> <span begin="0:41.405" end="0:41.665">out</span> <span begin="0:41.665" end="0:41.785">the</span> <span begin="0:41.785" end="0:42.475">key</span></p><p begin="0:42.475" end="0:44.835" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.475" end="0:43.115">Just</span> <span begin="0:43.115" end="0:43.425">liv</span><span begin="0:43.425" end="0:43.725">ing</span> <span begin="0:43.725" end="0:43.975">in</span> <span begin="0:43.975" end="0:44.075">a</span> <span begin="0:44.075" end="0:44.835">dream</span></p><p begin="0:44.835" end="0:46.425" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.835" end="0:45.055">It's</span> <span begin="0:45.055" end="0:45.415">just</span> <span begin="0:45.415" end="0:45.725">you</s