:01.095" end="1:01.215">me</span> <span begin="1:01.215" end="1:01.735">think</span><span begin="1:01.735" end="1:01.995">ing</span> <span begin="1:01.995" end="1:02.285">that</span> <span begin="1:02.285" end="1:02.815">I</span> <span begin="1:02.815" end="1:03.115">could</span> <span begin="1:03.115" end="1:03.415">be</span> <span begin="1:03.415" end="1:03.555">your</span> <span begin="1:03.555" end="1:04.195">mas</span><span begin="1:04.195" end="1:04.875">ter</span></p><p begin="1:05.285" end="1:09.765" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.285" end="1:05.725">Pret</span><span begin="1:05.725" end="1:05.835">ty</span> <span begin="1:05.835" end="1:06.525">ba</span><span begin="1:06.525" end="1:06.825">by,</span> <span begin="1:06.825" end="1:07.225">you're</span> <span begin="1:07.225" end="1:07.655">my</span> <span begin="1:07.655" end="1:07.935">hea</span><span begin="1:07.935" end="1:08.255">vy</span> <span begin="1:08.255" end="1:08.635">o</span><span begin="1:08.635" end="1:09.765">cean</span></p><p begin="1:09.975" end="1:13.915" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.975" end="1:10.265">Bring</span> <span begin="1:10.265" end="1:10.395">me</span> <span begin="1:10.395" end="1:11.145">down</span> <span begin="1:11.145" end="1:11.375">and</span> <span begin="1:11.375" end="1:11.945">give</span> <span begin="1:11.945" end="1:12.275">me</span> <span begin="1:12.275" end="1:12.515">your</span> <span begin="1:12.515" end="1:12.785">de</span><span begin="1:12.785" end="1:13.195">vo</span><span begin="1:13.195" end="1:13.915">tion</span></p><p begin="1:13.925" end="1:16.246" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.925" end="1:14.135">Tell</span> <span begin="1:14.135" end="1:14.295">me</span> <span begin="1:14.295" end="1:14.445">the</span> <span begin="1:14.445" end="1:14.725">things</span> <span begin="1:14.725" end="1:14.905">that</span> <span begin="1:14.905" end="1:15.125">you</span> <span begin="1:15.125" end="1:15.645">wan